>> x := Into okusha.
>> y := Into okusha.
>> z := x.
Okuphumayo bhala: (x = z), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (x = y), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (x ≠ y), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (x ≠ z), umugqa-omusha.
>> m := Isikhathi okusha unyaka: 2070, inyanga: 11.
>> n := m kopisha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (m = n), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (m ≠ n), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (m kuyefana: m), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (m kuyefana: n), umugqa-omusha.
n inyanga: 12.
Okuphumayo bhala: (m ≠ n), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (m = n), umugqa-omusha.


